 {
  id="mag-frost-method-celz",
  spec="Frost",
  label="Frost · Method · Celz lv 10-30",
  kind="priorities",
  default=false,
  note="Priorities only — no readable allocation. ◆ marks the talents the guide stresses. Source notes: No allocation could be extracted. A search summary said the guide splits points between Improved Frostbolt and Elemental Precision, but this could not be verified from the page text.",
  priorities="Frost is the preferred leveling spec. You chill and freeze at range with Frostbolt; Frostbite freezes, and Ice Lance hits frozen targets. One point in Fingers of Frost turns Chill into Fingers of Frost procs for Ice Lance. Blizzard and Cone of Cold for AoE; Frost Nova and Blink for distance. The build includes the 5 extra 'Talented' Legacy points (26 points at level 30). The point order is only in the page's interactive calculator dropdown, which isn't in the page text.",
  source={
   site="Method",
   author="Celz",
   title="WoW Forever Mage Leveling Guide & Talents",
   url="https://www.method.gg/wow-forever/wow-forever-mage-leveling-guide-and-talents",
   updated="2026-10-21",
