 {
  id="mag-frost-the-forever-era-the-forever-er",
  spec="Frost",
  label="Frost · The Forever Era lv 10-60",
  kind="priorities",
  default=false,
  note="Priorities only — no readable allocation. ◆ marks the talents the guide stresses. Source notes: No allocation is given. The text says the '16-point milestone arrives around 25-26', but with one point per level from 10, the 16th point lands at level 25. The page header says build 1.60.1.70170 (pre-hotfix).",
  priorities="Frost from 10 to 60. Levels 10-20: Frost talents that improve Frostbolt and slows. Then Shatter and the control talents ('your armour'). Branch into Fire or Arcane only from level 40, and only if playing in a group. Frost is described as the tree that does best in dungeons without a perfect tank. Use your highest Frostbolt rank if you want Frostbite procs, because low ranks proc talents less often.",
  source={
   site="The Forever Era",
   author="The Forever Era",
